@startuml state-match
title State Machine: Match (authority: Match Server; mirrored status in Backend) [P]
[*] --> ALLOCATING : Backend creates match
ALLOCATING --> WAITING_FOR_PLAYERS : AssignAck
ALLOCATING --> ABORTED : assign failed / timeout
WAITING_FOR_PLAYERS --> PRE_LAUNCH : all competitors connected\nor join timeout + no-show rule [TBD]
WAITING_FOR_PLAYERS --> CANCELLED : < 2 competitors present [TBD OQ-GP-17]
PRE_LAUNCH --> BATTLE : 5 s period elapsed [semantics TBD OQ-GP-01]
state BATTLE {
  [*] --> RUNNING
  RUNNING --> RUNNING : tick / elimination (BR-002)
}
BATTLE --> ENDED : remaining <= 1 (BR-003)\nor timeout [TBD OQ-GP-18]
ENDED --> COMPLETED : result accepted by Backend
ENDED --> DISPUTED : result rejected by validation
PRE_LAUNCH --> ABORTED : server failure
BATTLE --> ABORTED : server failure (BR-013)
WAITING_FOR_PLAYERS --> ABORTED : server failure
COMPLETED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
ABORTED --> [*]
DISPUTED --> [*] : resolved by admin
note right of BATTLE
  Per-competitor sub-state:
  CONNECTED -> DISCONNECTED (grace) -> CONNECTED
  ACTIVE -> ELIMINATED(reason) -> spectating
end note
@enduml
